granted counts each acquisition once — when granted (immediately or from queue). refused counts immediate refusals. expired counts wait expirations. Each acquire call ends in exactly one of granted/refused/expired. Validation errors don't count (they're not acquisitions — "每次占用恰好计入其一"... well, validation-throwing calls never occupied; and they threw TypeError/RangeError, not acquisitions. Don't count them.)

